;
; The machine front door of panic-attack: pointer-only (A7 ruling Q15). It names
; where to read and carries no facts of its own. Repository facts are in
; panic-attack_chora.deed; agent conventions are in .claude/CLAUDE.md. It
; replaces 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml, retired 2026-11-14
; (docs/history/A2ML-REMOVED.adoc).
;
; `panic-attack manifest` and `panic-attack diagnostics` read this file before
; any legacy 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml. A pointer-only manifest carries no report
; settings, so the built-in defaults apply (formats json and nickel, storage
; filesystem).
(repo-deed
  :schema-version "1.0.0"
  :canonical-name "panic-attack"
  :repo-uuid #uuid"a39ad6b1-51e0-854d-aa9a-d9ee97ba519b"
  :beholding-chora #uuid"0889b37b-defb-831f-973c-e119500db00e"
  (front-doors
    :machine "panic-attack_chora.deed"
    :human "README.adoc"))
